OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FEarly cloud and rain clears the
OL,6,Fsoutheast through the morning.
OL,7,FOtherwise, sunny spells and scattered
OL,8,Fshowers, with heavier, longer-lasting
OL,9,Fshowers in Scotland. Strong winds
OL,10,Facross the northern half of the UK and
OL,11,Fhigh ground. Cooler and fresher than
OL,12,Fprevious days.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FShowers affect northern and
OL,15,Fnorthwestern areas. Elsewhere remains
OL,16,Fmostly dry with long clear spells.
OL,17,FCooler than the previous night, with
OL,18,Fwinds gradually easing, especially
OL,19,Facross southern areas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
