OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FMostly dry with sunny
OL,6,Fspells. A few showers affect the
OL,7,Fnorthwest, with thicker cloud and rain
OL,8,Flater. Breezy at first in the far
OL,9,Fnorth before easing. Temperatures near
OL,10,Faverage.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
